  (https://github.com/openai/skills, skills/.curated/doc, spreadsheet and
  pdf), Apache License 2.0. The doc and spreadsheet skills were removed from
  that repository's main branch; they are taken from its own git history
  (doc at commit 77963424cd7687fd52e5fcfdd3f08d826ab9b1ab, spreadsheet at
  7b54889398822db28c72aeec8e95be7c20418d1a; pdf at
  49f948faa9258a0c61caceaf225e179651397431).

  powerpoint — a distilled adaptation of pptx-from-layouts
  (https://github.com/tristan-mcinnis/pptx-from-layouts-skill, commit
  46e7c6638305bcb424f257b5c49dcd2603dc71ea), MIT License, Copyright (c)
  2026 Tristan. The bundled Inner Chapter template embedded in the skill's
  generate.py comes from that repository.

  charts, data-analysis — adapted from K-Dense's scientific-agent-skills
  (https://github.com/K-Dense-AI/scientific-agent-skills, skills/
  scientific-visualization, exploratory-data-analysis and
  statistical-analysis, commit 92ace75ac21efe19a620434e0ca4e356081fe807),
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 K-Dense Inc.

  business-writing, themes — adapted from Anthropic's skills
